# Conformance probe pack for six-bit armor (spec 0.14). Public. A fixed-layout
# `bits` message read from armored text, in the shape of an AIS payload: a
# six-bit type selects the kind. Exercises the character map, the encode
# length L (an optional trailing field), `sixbit` with and without `trim`,
# a counted group, and fill bits.
format        conformance-armor
version       0.14.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          bits
word_bytes    1
bit_order     msb
armor         sixbit

field    probe.n      0:0:6     uint

kind     pos
when     0:0:6        1
field    probe.x      0:6:12    uint
field    lat          0:18:27   sscale:1/600000
field    callsign     0:45:42   sixbit   trim
field    probe.y      0:87:8    uint     optional

kind     name
when     0:0:6        2
field    probe.s1     0:6:120   sixbit

kind     list
when     0:0:6        3
field    probe.z      0:6:4     uint
group    probe.items  0:10      item 12  count 0:6:4
  field  probe.qty    0:0:12    uint
end
